    "resource_pattern": "Max increased mean wall time, steps, tools, and all captured token categories; longer Max trajectories sometimes accompanied success, but resource scale did not guarantee success (H04-X failed).",
    "solve_rate_decline": "Medium declined from 10/10 moderate to 7/10 hard and remained 7/10 in E006; Max declined from 8/10 moderate to 6/10 hard but rose to 9/10 in E006, so there was no monotonic decline across the final tier.",
    "very_hard_qualification": "E006 empirically separates from the moderate comparator through lower Medium completion, one both-fail pair, four withheld failures, and much longer historical trajectories. It was not uniformly harder than E005 on every metric: E006 Medium matched E005 at 7/10 while Max improved from 6/10 to 9/10."
